.TH JULES-TUI 1 "March 2026" "jules-vanager 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
jules-tui \- Terminal User Interface for Google Jules tasks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B jules-tui
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B jules-tui
is a Textual-based terminal dashboard to browse Jules sessions, monitor activity streams, read diffs, and reply to agent queries interactively.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show summary of options.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR jules-manager (1)
